[{"client_msg_id":"d10874a9-f498-4c2b-8d56-158ed641ca66","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"なんかクリティカルっぽい操作する前はきれいにしてからにすることにしてるから、そんなに困ったことない・・・","ts":"1617345992.067800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"daiji","count":3,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7","U8CC7MDCL","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G=T2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e25dc52-cf1e-4985-afdd-4456bd13181b","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"ちゃんと `git add` しないとインデックスは治らないけど","ts":"1617345948.067500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"106Mk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1127660-39dd-4fa4-94b2-21cbe577b521","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"あ\n普通に `git checkout --ours .` で復元できたかも","ts":"1617345930.067100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uz922"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f42f3385-8c49-4323-b0b3-0e52600b7fbe","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"gitの運用、人依存がめちゃくちゃ激しい","ts":"1617345780.065800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"75c6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb69f430-8806-4336-8d01-d3eab26b5ff6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"困ってるのは自分の運用が悪いのかもしれないけど","ts":"1617345740.065400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q/Ht5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"009be710-7955-4845-b518-cb4f412b6c73","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"にしても、もうちょっと簡単なやり方あるのかと思ってたんだけどやっぱり面倒なんですね・・・","ts":"1617345704.065000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iEBxe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"262230b6-f0a8-419c-94c9-92de83a0feed","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"このあたり詳しく乗ってます。\n\u003chttps://git-scm.com/book/ja/v2/Git-%E3%81%AE%E3%81%95%E3%81%BE%E3%81%96%E3%81%BE%E3%81%AA%E3%83%84%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB-%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6%E3%81%AA%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B8%E6%89%8B%E6%B3%95#r_manual_remerge|https://git-scm.com/book/ja/v2/Git-%E3%81%AE%E3%81%95%E3%81%BE%E3%81%96%E3%81%BE%E[…]%E5%BA%A6%E3%81%AA%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B8%E6%89%8B%E6%B3%95\u003e","ts":"1617345659.064400","thread_ts":"1617345566.062100","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tnxid"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"e89e29fc-40a2-4869-961b-2a38bf5fbe68","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"```git show :1:foo.txt # マージベース\ngit show :2:foo.txt # ローカルのもともとのファイル\ngit show :3:foo.txt # stash 内のファイル```","ts":"1617345566.062100","thread_ts":"1617345566.062100","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1617345576.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5gmjR"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"c5fb4be5-e0b8-4509-83f7-a236e4715cfe","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"便利すぎる","ts":"1617345646.064200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K/R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e5f38a0-66a9-4dc2-a409-8c69425165ce","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"知見","ts":"1617345612.063500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k0C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"077e6d66-147f-4818-b2da-b3e0050d6619","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"git stash-reset的な","ts":"1617345610.063300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+aMP8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a18f8a9-befd-493a-a2fe-e8536f98db36","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"`git show :n:xxx` ←コンフリクトステータス中に使えるやつです","ts":"1617345603.063100","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1617345614.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7mHHw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c0eb6c2-9839-4365-a097-1a5de9484e71","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これ汎用化したコマンドにしたい","ts":"1617345600.063000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HEsF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e89e29fc-40a2-4869-961b-2a38bf5fbe68","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"```git show :1:foo.txt # マージベース\ngit show :2:foo.txt # ローカルのもともとのファイル\ngit show :3:foo.txt # stash 内のファイル```","ts":"1617345566.062100","thread_ts":"1617345566.062100","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1617345576.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":2,"users":["UDDCM376D","U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5gmjR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54b92801-6f42-4a80-a481-7efa846971de","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```git show :1:foo.txt```\nこれ知らんかった…","ts":"1617345559.061900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AwJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cadc5243-1587-430f-80a8-b13204c280e2","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"何がいいんですかね。\n面倒だけど\n`git show :1:foo.txt` みたいにして元のファイルは出力できるので、\n`git show :1:foo.txt \u0026gt; foo.txt` みたいにするか\n今手元だと\n`foo.txt-e` というオリジナルファイルがあるので、これをリネームする感じですかね。","ts":"1617345501.060700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X2m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01f8f77f-0721-40b4-bb15-2f7210ecba40","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ローカルの変更は取り扱えない(gitとしてはindex/stageもしくはcommit(かstashでの退避がいる)ので操作できませんになると...","ts":"1617345346.059100","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1617345531.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H0d+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6a2329e-f1b6-4034-a941-14f78d2ec98e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"他に試せる手段ありましたっけ","ts":"1617345257.058100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K+u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ab58128-2767-4239-a496-3de0fe78a194","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"addしたらコンフリクトするのが今回言ってる状況としては正しそう\nresetしてもpop直前には戻ってくれないしrestoreしたらそのファイルの変更全部飛ぶし `merge --abort` も効かない","ts":"1617345225.057800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=DD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70598726-539e-4e18-baac-3dea0d7eec1c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"コンフリクトじゃなくてabortになってるものね","ts":"1617345180.057000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ss2sT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7be1dadd-e85e-4812-b06e-02997945db14","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; メッセージ\n↓だと思ってます。\n```error: Your local changes to the following files would be overwritten by merge:\n        foo.txt\nPlease commit your changes or stash them before you merge.\nAborting\nThe stash entry is kept in case you need it again.```","ts":"1617345085.055500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KGjZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e8468b0-c7b8-451f-bbb3-e7c9cefb7f42","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"メッセージは出ますが、何も変更はされてないので、「？」となってます。","ts":"1617345033.055100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X/yA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63bedeaa-a5c2-4520-a404-e50345d18e39","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あ、このメッセージすね","ts":"1617345007.054500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4azi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8bead019-ac4c-4eae-bb36-ad6e34fb95e1","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"一応 インデックスさえしておけば `git stash pop` でコンフリクトしました","ts":"1617344893.052900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_origina