g_id":"03d1882d-da3c-4f20-8fb3-f5687240277e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自分の理解だとそうですね（gitそんなに詳しくないんで間違っているかもですが）","ts":"1617344466.051100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f9U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86f8be44-4251-405f-95d9-e892a58385e9","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"一応ですが、branch 自体の更新とコンフリクトするのでなく、\nローカルの（インデックス or コミットされてない）差分とコンフリクトするってことですよね？","ts":"1617344254.050500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o1f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0854e86a-58e7-4d23-853f-35c26d10c4f9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"コンフリクトします","ts":"1617344043.049800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5HmXV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17486a4a-487c-4a4d-a884-340ade404d27","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"出ますね","ts":"1617344038.049600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xNkI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed102264-26f1-4d7d-ab29-c98abba1f6a8","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"知らなかった。設定の問題なのかな…","ts":"1617344029.049300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rGE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c4cd7f7-a40c-4d9c-826e-35e77aeed378","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"ワーキングツリーに、コンフリクトマーカー（ `\u0026lt;\u0026lt;\u0026lt;\u0026lt;` みたいなやつ）が出てくる感じですか？","ts":"1617344008.048800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E=0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aad44d4-0062-407a-8c36-b11ed810bc49","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"大体直しちゃいますが","ts":"1617343977.048100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xYNH9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43c4dfb0-1d81-42e6-a024-1019f7a51cb0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ぼくよくやります","ts":"1617343968.047900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y/j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f44c582-6f46-4d1b-be1a-5437f6c53378","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"コンフリクトしますね","ts":"1617343965.047700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=+VtR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd70959a-9200-459f-9fdb-a869581c9d92","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"手元だと単に stash pop が失敗する","ts":"1617343684.047400","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1617343691.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dfj6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d407aa3d-7aac-4211-8f44-663d11eceeaf","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"そもそも git stash pop って、conflict するときワーキングツリー更新されますっけ…？\n（手元で再現しない）","ts":"1617343657.047100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"89+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fbb4836-4114-4ada-9435-8754e0a67dad","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u0026gt; うーん、not stagedなファイルがある状態でpopしてconflictしたときとかすごい面倒なんですよね\nnot staged なファイルも一緒に stash してしまえば、conflictしにくいかなーと思ったんですが","ts":"1617343510.046200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"86/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70eb3d57-70e8-4a47-8a94-b6e527c6f46e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"あ、git stash するときに、 `-u` するのはどうですかね？\n```-u\n--include-untracked\n\n    This option is only valid for push and save commands.\n    All untracked files are also stashed and then cleaned up with git clean.```\nらしいですけど","ts":"1617343334.045500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AQr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a0b38d7-12b0-4db6-b0e1-99be94d43434","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; なのでstash popを上書きしてやろうと思ったらpop以外の処理をstash本体に流す仕組みか、stash自体を再実装する必要がありそう\nですよねえ\n多分こうしないとだめだろうなって思って面倒そうだなって思いました","ts":"1617342887.044700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TIUG3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8900dded-59d8-4077-80f7-0e17aafd3475","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"バイナリじゃなくてPythonスクリプトだった","ts":"1617342471.044200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j4yGi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8b41ca1-ed1c-426b-a77e-f3f30b6b7c20","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"やっぱりそうでした\n`git-clang-format` っていうバイナリがあるんですけど、これを呼び出すには `git clang-format` じゃないと無理ですね\nstashのサブコマンドだけを都合よく生やす事はできない","ts":"1617342437.043900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"12WZa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7e019e8-00f7-44d7-8904-9b48db6d794c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"なのでstash popを上書きしてやろうと思ったらpop以外の処理をstash本体に流す仕組みか、stash自体を再実装する必要がありそう\nまあ名前だけの話なので、エイリアスと割り切って別名で定義してもいいと思いますけど","ts":"1617342234.041800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JNMtL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83ec849b-b302-49c5-8af9-1143cdefd42c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1617342140.040200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5e9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"808f8ec3-0235-47c2-b088-bdd5153ccca3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"この手の方法で定義したサブコマンドのサブコマンドはそのサブコマンド内で定義してやらないと動かないっていうのがよくあるケース\ngitはどうなのか知らないですけど、cargoはそうだった気がする","ts":"1617342107.040000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=0az"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5eb2350a-bbf1-4333-b002-42c91b722e6e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、でも上書き色々面倒そうだな","ts":